# Vest working rules

1. Read `AGENTS.md`, then `docs/CURRENT.md`, then `docs/standing-backlog.md` before any work.
2. Take work only from the standing backlog — do not invent scope from historical backlog prose.
3. Fail closed: deny by default for agent tools, unknown effects, bad config. Approval is never forged — an `Allow` decision must come from the policy engine.
4. Docs honesty: a checkbox marked done must match shipped behaviour. Do not claim unimplemented features.
5. Commit: `main` only, Zelmari author, no `Co-authored-by:` trailers. Commit after each meaningful change.
